# The installer module's signals (docs/wrappfile.md#signals), named
# installer.<signal>.
#
# installer.alive: a sign an install is still getting somewhere, which the
# stall watch counts (docs/wrapp-build.md#a-stalled-install): Wine's
# programs working, a line in the installer's own log, or the folders an
# install writes to growing.
SIGNAL alive --any
  WATCH --wine.busy
  WATCH --log="${program.log}" --matches="."
  WATCH --grows="C:/Program Files (x86)"
  WATCH --grows="C:/users"
END
